  "historyNote": "#7979, eff 10-22-03; ss by #10012, INTERIM, eff 10-22-11, EXPIRES: 4-19-12; ss by #10116, eff 4-19-12; ss by #12680, eff 11-27-18 (formerly He-P 2103.09)",
